  "body": "Three flats. One prime site. Endless potential and a exciting opportunity. What will you create?\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked away down a quiet driveway, this substantial 1,178m² parcel of prime Mixed Housing Urban land in Kohimarama offers an exciting opportunity for investors, developers and buyers with vision.\r\n\r\nCurrently configured as three separate flats, the property generates an impressive $1,775 per week in rental income, providing holding income while you plan your next move.\r\n\r\nEqually appealing for multi-generational living, the three separate flats offer flexibility for extended families wanting to live close together while still enjoying their own space and independence.\r\n\r\nRenovate, redevelop or completely reimagine - the choice is yours! With stunning sea views, a private setting and a premium coastal address, the possibilities here are well worth exploring.\r\n\r\nEnjoy everything Kohimarama has to offer, from beautiful beaches and waterfront dining to local cafes, boutique shops, parks and excellent schools. Mission Bay and the wider Eastern Bays are all just moments away.\r\n\r\nACT NOW - THIS PROPERTY WILL BE SOLD AT AUCTION!\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this scale in Kohimarama are few and far between. Don't wait until auction day to explore the potential. Contact us today for further information or to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nAgents - all conjunctional offers are warmly welcomed. Bring your buyers!\r\n\r\nAUCTION: 12PM, Thursday 17th December 2026 | Onsite at 14A Hawera Road, Kohimarama (unless sold prior)",
